; The one variable: `self_modulate = Color(0.5, 1, 0.5, 0.8)` on a GraphEdit that holds one connection. The
; connection draws on a child Control (`graph_edit.cpp:290`), so it keeps its colour; the panel takes the tint.
; Another scene would not show a regression here: no other golden tints a GraphEdit that has a connection.

